  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "kind": "label",
      "attach": false,
      "text": "# Forkful\nA food delivery marketplace: **120k** restaurants, **2M** couriers, **40** orders a second at dinner.",
      "style": {
        "role": "title"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "states",
      "kind": "label",
      "about": "orders",
      "attach": false,
      "text": "### Order states\n| State | Moved by |\n| --- | --- |\n| `PLACED` | Customer |\n| `ACCEPTED` | Restaurant |\n| `PICKED_UP` | Courier |\n| `DELIVERED` | Courier |\n| `CANCELLED` | Order Saga |",
      "style": {
        "background": "card",
        "color": "blue"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tip",
      "kind": "label",
      "about": "saga",
      "attach": false,
      "text": "> [!TIP]\n> Every saga step is idempotent, keyed by order id: Temporal may run an activity twice after a crash."
    },
    {
      "id": "clock",
      "kind": "label",
      "about": "tickets",
      "attach": false,
      "text": "3 minutes, or we refund",
      "style": {
        "font": "hand",
        "color": "rose"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n.saga",
      "kind": "decision",
      "about": "saga",
      "text": "An orchestrated saga on Temporal: an order's whole story lives in one workflow, so a stuck order is one query away."
    },
    {
      "id": "n.wf",
      "kind": "code",
      "about": "start",
      "language": "typescript",
      "code": "const hold = await authorize(order);\nundo.push(() => refund(hold));\nconst ticket = await sendTicket(order);\nundo.push(() => cancelTicket(ticket));\nconst ok = await condition(() => answered, '3 min');\nif (!ok || rejected) return unwind(undo);\nawait findCourier(order);"
    },
    {
      "id": "n.outbox",
      "kind": "code",
      "about": "stage",
      "language": "sql",
      "code": "BEGIN;\nINSERT INTO orders (id, customer_id, total, state)\n  VALUES ($1, $2, 3250, 'PLACED');\nINSERT INTO outbox (aggregate_id, type, payload)\n  VALUES ($1, 'OrderPlaced', $3);\nCOMMIT;"
    },
    {
      "id": "n.event",
      "kind": "code",
      "about": "relay",
      "language": "json",
      "code": "{\n  \"type\": \"OrderPlaced\",\n  \"orderId\": \"o_9f31\",\n  \"restaurant\": \"r_ramen_42\",\n  \"items\": [{ \"dish\": \"tonkotsu\", \"qty\": 2 }],\n  \"total\": { \"amount\": 3250, \"currency\": \"EUR\" }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "n.redis",
      "kind": "warning",
      "about": "locations",
      "text": "Courier positions live only in Redis: a failover loses the last few seconds, which the apps send again."
    },
    {
      "id": "n.payout",
      "kind": "question",
      "about": "payouts",
      "text": "Weekly payouts, or instant cash-out for couriers for a small fee?"
    }
  ],
  "sequences": [
    {
      "id": "seq-order",
      "title": "Place an order, message by message",
      "mermaid": "sequenceDiagram\n  participant app as Customer App\n  participant ord as Orders API\n  participant saga as Order Saga\n  participant pay as Payments\n  participant kit as Restaurant Integration\n  participant dis as Dispatch\n  app->>+ord: POST /orders\n  ord->>saga: Start PlaceOrder\n  ord-->>-app: 201 Order\n  saga->>+pay: Authorize €32.50\n  pay-->>-saga: hold id\n  saga->>kit: SendTicket\n  alt accepted within 3 min\n    kit-->>saga: Accepted, ready in 18 min\n    critical courier booked\n      saga->>dis: FindCourier\n      dis-->>saga: Courier on the way\n    end\n  else rejected, or no answer\n    saga->>kit: CancelTicket\n    saga->>pay: Refund payment\n  end",
      "links": {
        "app": "capp",
        "ord": "orders",
        "saga": "saga",
        "pay": "payments",
        "kit": "integration",
        "dis": "dispatch"
      }
    }
  ],
